{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01308",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.8,
      "end_seconds": 8.84,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "hello doctor um sorry I took a wrong turn on the the way here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.21,
      "end_seconds": 15.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "Right, you're alright, take a a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.4,
      "end_seconds": 22.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "I've been dealing with a tight band around my head"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.24,
      "end_seconds": 28.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "How long has it been like this? Take your time there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.74,
      "end_seconds": 34.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "It's been going on for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.37,
      "end_seconds": 45.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.52,
      "end_seconds": 53.74,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "It happens a few times a day. Mostly moderate. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.66,
      "end_seconds": 58.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.67,
      "end_seconds": 69.86,
      "duration_seconds": 10.19,
      "text": "when it starts I tend to get tired eyes as well. The tired eyes? That's been for two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.62,
      "end_seconds": 84.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.03,
      "end_seconds": 88.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.58,
      "end_seconds": 96.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.46,
      "end_seconds": 101.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.08,
      "end_seconds": 104.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.73,
      "end_seconds": 108.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I I have an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.8,
      "end_seconds": 123.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.16,
      "end_seconds": 127.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "no, I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.15,
      "end_seconds": 130.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "let's run through your medicines"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.63,
      "end_seconds": 139.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "Metoprolol 50 milligrams twice a day for the heart rhythm. It's paracetamol 1 gram when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.89,
      "end_seconds": 159.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.84,
      "end_seconds": 162.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.56,
      "end_seconds": 167.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "any sensitivity to light, sickness or blurred vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.71,
      "end_seconds": 176.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "no sensitivity to light, sickness or blurred vision, none of it it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.54,
      "end_seconds": 180.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.52,
      "end_seconds": 184.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.94,
      "end_seconds": 188.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.84,
      "end_seconds": 201.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.67,
      "end_seconds": 224.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.25,
      "text": "okay: pulse 76, pressure 119 over 71, temp 36.4 degrees and SpO2 99 percent on room air"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.54,
      "end_seconds": 229.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "okay time for me to examine you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.03,
      "end_seconds": 232.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "yeah, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.98,
      "end_seconds": 235.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Does that that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.68,
      "end_seconds": 254.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Your neck and shoulder muscles are tight, and your eye movements are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.13,
      "end_seconds": 260.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "all finished, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.63,
      "end_seconds": 282.15,
      "duration_seconds": 10.52,
      "text": "so, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like tension-type headache. Let's book an eye test to look into eye strain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.15,
      "end_seconds": 285.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "mm, alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.32,
      "end_seconds": 298.66,
      "duration_seconds": 11.34,
      "text": "take screen breaks every hour and try regular neck stretches if the headache becomes sudden and severe that's the point to come in urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.76,
      "end_seconds": 302.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Alright, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.22,
      "end_seconds": 309.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "come back in four weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.09,
      "end_seconds": 312.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "alright thanks take care"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.0,
      "end_seconds": 315.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
